{"4378250": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Organizer Pro", "steam_appid": 4378250, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ever wondered if you could organize a hoard? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy seeing BEFORE and AFTER transformations? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here's your chance to organize over 15,000 objects! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are 30 levels... NO time limits, NO rules. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize everything EXACTLY how you want it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Organize everything with precise controls (shoe at the end of the video is showing the game mechanics).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What to expect:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will enter a main lobby (with music) where you can select any level 1-30.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each level is it's own individual scene. Expect a variety of objects to organize in each scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 30 levels, expect to spend approximately 1 hour in each level, so approximately 30 total hours of playtime to complete the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Because of the high volume of objects, expect longer than normal loading/saving times.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>What this game is not:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not a cleaning game. There is nothing gross to clean. The game focuses strictly on decluttering and organizing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has no story, no character, no built-in challenges/quests, no variety of game modes. It is simply taking objects from a pile and placing them where you want.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is <i>NOT FOR EVERYONE</i>. This game is <i>ONLY </i>for those who enjoy arranging items and seeing the before and after transformations of a space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---